{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（28日）早上7時54分，警方接報指，黃大仙雙鳳街14號一麵包舖有一幅面積約4米乘3米的天花，連同石屎一同剝落倒塌，擊中一名26歲女顧客。傷者額頭及手臂受傷，救援人員在場為其治理，稍後將送院治理。</p><p>從網上圖片可見，剝落的天花及石屎碎片散落一地。</p><p>現場可見，麵包舖內滿目蒼夷，大塊石屎從天花剝落，月餅包裝上亦佈滿石屎碎片。警員圍封鎖現場調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"月餅包裝上佈滿石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934793803042816756021.jpeg/WW6G9Xg5HtAVv0RPbZ-X9BqFtM_xEJvoNXlIzxB5SM8\"/><figcaption>月餅包裝上佈滿石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"假天花塌下。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169935028939919360460235.jpeg/AB8kaAUwGOySBmVBLq8aSW67nXobCDx3WvLWP3_y1j8\"/><figcaption>假天花塌下。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃大仙雙鳳街14號一麵包舖有一幅面積3米乘2米的天花，連同石屎一同剝落倒塌，碎片散落一地，一名顧客受傷。（慈雲山資訊交流/Coral Shum圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169923621200596992738501.png/XkehETYG10oHjCUfUtevTmYGDC8b1nOmis3AporNwKY\"/><figcaption>黃大仙雙鳳街14號一麵包舖有一幅面積3米乘2米的天花，連同石屎一同剝落倒塌，碎片散落一地，一名顧客受傷。（慈雲山資訊交流/Coral Shum圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封鎖現場。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934662261280768410572.jpeg/aBbV3dRsRtHT-B9WgMgr8bLlG56WRS5ws0Z_opZGf6I\"/><figcaption>警員圍封鎖現場。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"職員從涉事店舖內走出。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934665268727808560238.jpeg/WZYyxVuMu3tv4ilMqbccPAmGP2gruqzmtfNR2pDzUdo\"/><figcaption>職員從涉事店舖內走出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場遺下一地石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934668301340672521379.jpeg/JRNv9gyB78jZhQnMFuTg8-wN2xsb2b86jrZ6SKu2ekg\"/><figcaption>現場遺下一地石屎碎片。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934672357363712796043.jpeg/2oPR7tmwiudIapC6Gfu1zTSkbOuZL447KNMsaQ3TLGk\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934675314479104841657.jpeg/JXc8oSx5w82K4BA9ZXrTPKBXe5IRyl0xi6YFfa6mBX0\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934660650668032604218.jpeg/mB6WRcs7AUynK6zJy22nvqfqQJVmJLul2rufp_-7n6c\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大量石屎碎片懷疑從天花剝落。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934664668942336263579.jpeg/5U5skKD0JxPKG3AYYpgccewZtsL-FjpBWKXunn2l7p4\"/><figcaption>大量石屎碎片懷疑從天花剝落。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大塊石屎從天而降。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934671229095936619872.jpeg/JZzrGhyY7Q52Q2kLpx6Z4JkOE2HKfgaPGvM6qj_zOqo\"/><figcaption>大塊石屎從天而降。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260828/1169934674186211328623457.jpeg/lwqas7s0kyrUM_SAPtKa-6J47NM9g9KH6zp0e846dHs\"/><figcaption>店內滿目蒼夷。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T01:20:07.067962+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}